-  · rw [div_mul_cancel₀ _ hρs.ne']
-    linarith only [hR0, hZs]
-  · rw [le_div_iff₀ hρs]
-    linarith only [mul_nonneg (by linarith only [hR0, hZs] : 0 ≤ 2 * R0 + Zs + 2)
